  "worked_solution": "The polygons $P$ and $Q$ are congruent because $Q$ is the image of $P$ under the action of translation by $5$ units to the right and $5$ units down.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14214989/assets/15120f2beae5043dd439f62bbc376f9b660ec97cf2541c5e2cb28e363ceed202.png)",
